# Cursor Cloud Extra High

Use MCP `cloud_launch`, `cloud_wait`, `cloud_status`, and `cloud_result` (or `scripts/launch-cloud-extra-high.sh`). Set `GCS_CLOUD_REPO` or `CLOUD_REPO_URL` before create. Do not print API keys. After `CLOUD_LAUNCH_OK`, invoke `cloud_wait` / `scripts/cloud/spawn-waiter.sh` so a waiter A2A-pings the owning seat `FLEET_DONE`; do not block the Director turn on watch.

LIV-41: directors themselves monitor their bc-ids. A turn without watching its own grunt is FAIL. Never Bot CloudAgent.
